        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "World of Outlaws: Sprint Cars is a dirt-track racing game that puts you behind the wheel of a sprint car, racing through mud and oil at iconic real-world venues. Solo players push hard against real champion drivers, while multiplayer fans can race with friends through a mix of split-screen and online modes.\n\nWith distinctive winged sprint cars, real-time track deformation that forces you to adapt your racing line, and a variety of tracks from the World of Outlaws series, the game delivers fast, gritty racing with plenty of competitive options for both online and offline sessions.",
          "source": "igdb",
