        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Start as a local track racer and work your way up the ranks to become the next World of Outlaws champion. Upgrade your car, team, and facilities to stay competitive with the best of the best.\n\nRace in both the premier World of Outlaws Sprint Car and Late Model Series, as well as 4 additional DIRTcar classes across more than 40 tracks.\n\nRace at iconic real-world venues like Eldora, Volusia, Williams Grove, and more! World of Outlaws: Dirt Racing features 14 officially licensed tracks and many others inspired by real world venues!",
